<title>POLAND: Polish yr/yr PPI 11.4 pct in August vs 11.6 July.</title>
<headline>Polish yr/yr PPI 11.4 pct in August vs 11.6 July.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish producer prices rose 0.9 percent in August against a 0.8 percent rise in July, taking year-on-year producer price inflation down to 11.4 percent, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said producer prices rose 7.2 percent in the January-August period, compared with a 13.2 percent rise in the same period last year.  </p>
<p> POLISH PRODUCER INFLATION     AUGUST	JULY    AUGUST 1995</p>
<p> month/month change (pct)	  0.9	  0.8	 1.3</p>
<p> yr/yr change (pct)		 11.4	 11.6	25.4</p>
<p>  manufacturing m/m change	 1.0	  0.8	 1.3</p>
<p>  manufacturing yr/yr change    10.0	 10.3	26.0</p>
<p>  mining m/m change		  1.2	  2.1	 2.1</p>
<p>  mining yr/yr change	     13.8	 12.6	22.0</p>
<p>  utilities m/m change	     0.0	  0.1	 1.4</p>
<p>  utilities yr/yr change	  11.3	 12.6	26.8</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
